OL,3,ADiabetes and ADHD drugs to be tested on
OL,4,AAlzheimer's patients in new study
OL,5,
OL,6,FAngela Bucksey, 67, from
OL,7,FCambridgeshire, was diagnosed with
OL,8,FAlzheimer's in January and is the first
OL,9,Fperson to begin treatment on the trial,
OL,10,Fcalled AD-SMART.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
